  "obligation": "Execute scalar Wasm globals as independently rooted instance bindings in the shared VM; preserve raw bits, global mutability validation, nested-call ownership, aliases and collection safety.",
  "representation": "WasmGlobal derives type from its initial scalar and owns mutability. Shared immutable module metadata is Rc-owned. Each WasmInstance owns a generation-checked root to the existing Environment cell. Global reads/writes lower to LoadCapture/StoreCapture in the same dispatch loop. Script exports map kind/index to one instance; reads and invokes share binding instantiation. No second scalar representation, global-value side map, opcode or residual version is introduced.",
